{
    "__inputs": [
      { "name": "DS_LOKI", "label": "Loki", "type": "datasource", "pluginId": "loki" }
    ],
    "__requires": [
      { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "11.0.0" },
      { "type": "datasource", "id": "loki", "name": "Loki", "version": "1.0.0" },
      { "type": "panel", "id": "logs", "name": "Logs", "version": "" },
      { "type": "panel", "id": "stat", "name": "Stat", "version": "" },
      { "type": "panel", "id": "timeseries", "name": "Time series", "version": "" },
      { "type": "panel", "id": "table", "name": "Table", "version": "" },
      { "type": "panel", "id": "text", "name": "Text", "version": "" },
      { "type": "panel", "id": "piechart", "name": "Pie chart", "version": "" }
    ],
    "uid": "copilot-loki-logs",
    "title": "Copilot \u2014 Logs (Loki)",
    "description": "GitHub Copilot OTel log events from Loki. Covers session starts, GenAI inference events, errors, and full event stream. Uses Loki field naming convention (underscores throughout).",
    "tags": ["copilot", "logs", "loki", "logql", "genai"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "refresh": "30s",
    "time": { "from": "now-3h", "to": "now" },
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        { "name": "service_name", "type": "query", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" }, "query": "label_values(service_name)", "refresh": 2, "multi": true, "includeAll": true, "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }, "label": "Service" },
        { "name": "model", "type": "query", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" }, "query": "label_values(gen_ai_request_model)", "refresh": 2, "multi": true, "includeAll": true, "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }, "label": "Model" },
        { "name": "level", "type": "custom", "query": "ALL,info,warn,error,debug", "multi": false, "includeAll": false, "current": { "text": "ALL", "value": "ALL" }, "label": "Log Level" },
        { "name": "search", "type": "textbox", "current": { "text": "", "value": "" }, "label": "Search text" }
      ]
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 999, "type": "text", "title": "\u2139\ufe0f How to use this dashboard",
        "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "## Copilot Logs \u2014 Loki\n\n**Source:** OTel log records emitted by GitHub Copilot Chat, forwarded via your pipeline to Loki's native OTLP endpoint (`/otlp/v1/logs`).\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Naming convention\nLoki uses **underscores** for all field names, unlike VictoriaMetrics (dots). So `gen_ai.request.model` in traces/metrics becomes `gen_ai_request_model` in Loki.\n\n**Confirmed Loki fields:** `service_name`, `gen_ai_request_model`, `gen_ai_response_model`, `gen_ai_operation_name`, `gen_ai_agent_name`, `gen_ai_usage_input_tokens`, `gen_ai_usage_output_tokens`, `gen_ai_request_max_tokens`, `gen_ai_response_finish_reasons`, `gen_ai_response_id`, `event_name`, `session_id`, `span_id`, `scope_name`, `detected_level`\n\n**Confirmed log line patterns:**\n- `GenAI inference: gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18`\n- `GenAI inference: claude-sonnet-4.6`\n- `copilot_chat.session.start`\n\n### Filters\n- **Service** \u2014 `copilot-chat` (extension) or `github-copilot` (CLI sessions)\n- **Model** \u2014 filters by `gen_ai_request_model` label (only populated if Loki exporter promotes this to a label, otherwise use the panel-level `| json` filter)\n- **Log Level** \u2014 filters by `detected_level`\n- **Search text** \u2014 free-text search across all log lines\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Label vs parsed field\nIf `service_name` is not promoted to a Loki **label** in your exporter config, `{service_name=~\"...\"}` won't work \u2014 use `{} | json | service_name=~\"...\"` instead. Check your Loki exporter's `labels:` config block." }
      },
      { "id": 200, "type": "row", "title": "Volume Overview", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 }, "collapsed": false },
      {
        "id": 1, "type": "stat", "title": "Total Log Events",
        "description": "Count of all Copilot OTel log lines in the selected time range. This includes session starts, inference events, and all other event types.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Total Events" }],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82E6" }, "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 } },
        "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
      },
      {
        "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Error Events",
        "description": "Count of log lines containing 'error' or detected_level=error. Rising values here should be investigated via the error log panel below.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 8 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"error\" [$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Error Events" }],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "#5BA85B", "value": null }, { "color": "#F0954A", "value": 5 }, { "color": "#E0524A", "value": 20 }] } },
        "overrides": [] },
        "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
      },
      {
        "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Session Starts",
        "description": "Count of copilot_chat.session.start events. Each represents a developer opening a new Copilot Chat session.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"copilot_chat.session.start\" [$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Session Starts" }],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5BA85B" }, "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 } },
        "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
      },
      {
        "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "GenAI Inference Events",
        "description": "Count of 'GenAI inference:' log lines — one per LLM call. This is the most direct log-level measure of model invocations.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 8 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"GenAI inference\" [$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Inference Events" }],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0" }, "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 } },
        "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
      },
      { "id": 201, "type": "row", "title": "Event Volume Over Time", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 }, "collapsed": false },
      {
        "id": 10, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Log Event Rate Over Time",
        "description": "Rate of all Copilot log events per minute. Spikes indicate active usage periods. Gaps could mean VS Code is not sending telemetry (check OTel config).",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [
          { "expr": "sum(rate({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"GenAI inference\" [5m]))", "legendFormat": "Inference events/min" },
          { "expr": "sum(rate({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"session.start\" [5m]))", "legendFormat": "Session starts/min" },
          { "expr": "sum(rate({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"error\" [5m]))", "legendFormat": "Error events/min" }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 } }, "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Error events/min" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#E0524A" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Session starts/min" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5BA85B" } }] }
        ] },
        "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
      },
      {
        "id": 11, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Inference Events by Model Over Time",
        "description": "Rate of inference log events broken out by model name extracted from the log line. Shows which models are being called and when.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [
          { "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (rate({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\" [5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}" }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 } } },
        "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
      },
      { "id": 202, "type": "row", "title": "Token Usage from Logs", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 }, "collapsed": false },
      {
        "id": 20, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Input Token Usage Over Time (from Logs)",
        "description": "Input token counts extracted from log field gen_ai_usage_input_tokens, summed over time. Cross-reference with the VictoriaMetrics dashboard for the same metric via counter. Log-derived values are useful as an independent check.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | gen_ai_usage_input_tokens != \"\" | unwrap gen_ai_usage_input_tokens [5m]))", "legendFormat": "Input Tokens" }],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0" }, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2 } } },
        "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
      },
      {
        "id": 21, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Output Token Usage Over Time (from Logs)",
        "description": "Output token counts extracted from log field gen_ai_usage_output_tokens, summed over time.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | gen_ai_usage_output_tokens != \"\" | unwrap gen_ai_usage_output_tokens [5m]))", "legendFormat": "Output Tokens" }],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5BA85B" }, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2 } } },
        "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
      },
      { "id": 203, "type": "row", "title": "Session Analysis", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 }, "collapsed": false },
      {
        "id": 30, "type": "table", "title": "Recent Sessions",
        "description": "Most recent Copilot Chat sessions with session_id, model, operation, and token usage. Useful for identifying specific sessions to drill into. Click session_id to filter logs below.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | session_id != \"\" | line_format \"{{.session_id}} | {{.gen_ai_request_model}} | {{.gen_ai_operation_name}} | in={{.gen_ai_usage_input_tokens}} out={{.gen_ai_usage_output_tokens}}\"", "legendFormat": "" }],
        "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "desc": true, "displayName": "Time" }] }
      },
      { "id": 204, "type": "row", "title": "Error Analysis", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 49 }, "collapsed": false },
      {
        "id": 40, "type": "logs", "title": "Error Log Events",
        "description": "Live tail of log lines containing 'error'. Inspect these for rate limit messages, auth failures, timeout messages, and any backend errors reaching VS Code. Use the search filter above to narrow by keyword.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 50 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service_name\"} |= \"error\" ${search:pipe_labelfilter}", "legendFormat": "" }],
        "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" }
      },
      {
        "id": 41, "type": "piechart", "title": "Finish Reasons Distribution",
        "description": "Distribution of gen_ai_response_finish_reasons from log fields. A high proportion of anything other than 'stop' or 'end_turn' warrants investigation (e.g. max_tokens reached, content_filter).",
        "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 60 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_response_finish_reasons) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | gen_ai_response_finish_reasons != \"\" [$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_response_finish_reasons}}" }],
        "options": { "pieType": "donut", "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] } }
      },
      {
        "id": 42, "type": "piechart", "title": "Events by Service Name",
        "description": "Volume split between copilot-chat (VS Code extension) and github-copilot (CLI sessions). Shows relative usage between chat and terminal-based workflows.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 60 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum by (service_name) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} [$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}" }],
        "options": { "pieType": "donut", "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] } }
      },
      {
        "id": 43, "type": "piechart", "title": "Events by Operation Type",
        "description": "Split of log events by gen_ai_operation_name (chat, execute_tool, invoke_agent). Shows what proportion of logged events are conversational vs agentic vs tool-call.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 60 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_operation_name) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | gen_ai_operation_name != \"\" [$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_operation_name}}" }],
        "options": { "pieType": "donut", "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] } }
      },
      { "id": 205, "type": "row", "title": "Full Log Stream", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 69 }, "collapsed": false },
      {
        "id": 50, "type": "logs", "title": "All Copilot Events \u2014 Live Tail",
        "description": "Complete raw event stream from Copilot OTel logs. Use the filters at the top (Service, Model, Level, Search) to narrow. Enable 'Log details' on a row to inspect all parsed JSON fields including session_id, span_id, token counts, and finish reasons.",
        "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 70 },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
        "targets": [{ "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | json | gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"", "legendFormat": "" }],
        "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": true, "wrapLogMessage": false, "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" }
      }
    ],
    "annotations": { "list": [] },
    "links": [
      { "title": "Metrics Dashboard", "url": "/d/copilot-vm-metrics", "icon": "external link", "type": "link" },
      { "title": "Traces Dashboard", "url": "/d/copilot-tempo-traces", "icon": "external link", "type": "link" }
    ]
  }